        "customDisplayName": "Concatenate water-body-testing-2002..2023 tables; filter rows where Beach Type Description == 'Marine' (case-insensitive); compute annual marine exceedance rate as (# Violation in {'yes','y','true','1'}) / total samples; compute year-over-year difference in annual exceedance rate (current minus previous year); return the single year with the maximum YoY exceedance-rate difference along with the diff value",
